in devastating news today Middle Earth  shadow of Mordor executive producer  Michael 4G passed away at 3:15 a.m. on  March 3rd from a rare form of brain  cancer his last few days were peaceful  with his family by his side reads an  update on his YouCaring page where money  was being raised to cover his medical  expenses and support his children's  future Mike was so touched by everyone's  support during his fight his family  wants to thank everyone for their kind  words and support during this difficult  time you caring page was put together in  September at the same time monolith  studios organized an event called for 4G  in order to raise awareness about four  G's position the company encouraged fans  to play in streams shadow of mordor with  the 404 G hashtag according to an update  post in January 4G enjoy a holiday  season with his family and a recent MRI  showed a 15 to 20 percent reduction in  the tumour residing in his brain this  was the last update posted before the  notice of death on March 4th 4G also  worked on the first two years of war  games fable and conquer our thoughts go  out to his friends and family
 

